                        "sense_id": "cbf5d8ee-a13e-3ae3-9639-1c74980c8c2c",
                        "entry_id": "9aea5c68-77d9-3a4c-91de-04e5bde90784",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of various plants of coastal or sandy regions, especially a small tree Acacia longifolia (subsp. sophorae), and various flowering plants in the genus Myoporum in the figwort family."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e90df886-1fea-4908-8d7c-c4647c4985e3",
                                "sense_id": "cbf5d8ee-a13e-3ae3-9639-1c74980c8c2c",
                                "text": "I grabbed them and splashed across the river and up the far bank, backed deep into a boobialla bush and pulled them in after me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b87e2eed-d621-48fd-9d2e-14a84a746a84",
                                "sense_id": "cbf5d8ee-a13e-3ae3-9639-1c74980c8c2c",
                                "text": "One hundred and ninety-five years later, I look out over a strip of emerald boobyallas onto a deserted nine-mile beach."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c897e6ec-9244-4058-bf16-97522d559151",
                                "sense_id": "cbf5d8ee-a13e-3ae3-9639-1c74980c8c2c",
                                "text": "And remember dead boobialla branches have one aim when you are gathering them, chopping them, lopping them, splitting them, breaking them under your boot – and that aimm is to gouge out your eye, to lance your hands, to trip you up, to deflect the axe into your boot, to kill you if possible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "171d3e06-7024-4d49-a240-021d85c832c8",
                                "sense_id": "cbf5d8ee-a13e-3ae3-9639-1c74980c8c2c",
                                "text": "A vast forest of Boobialla trees, growing completely out of control, spread widely right to the very foreshore of the station.[…]At a later date, I would be responsible for clearing this boobialla with my trusty chainsaw."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
